{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/1147c0dea46a44355b90a358e672e0d0.poster.avif?t=1759946563\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/1147c0dea46a44355b90a358e672e0d0.webm?t=1759946563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/1147c0dea46a44355b90a358e672e0d0.mp4?t=1759946563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/dcb661af975915c585210131627c333d.avif?t=1759946563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras_big/dcb661af975915c585210131627c333d.avif?t=1759946563 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/ab2ed92b398b340d3079f221f01cfba8.poster.avif?t=1759946563\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/ab2ed92b398b340d3079f221f01cfba8.webm?t=1759946563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/ab2ed92b398b340d3079f221f01cfba8.mp4?t=1759946563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Operation Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Pawns</strong> zooms into the <i>deep state</i> of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe full of <strong>pawns</strong>, <strong>chaos</strong> and <i>hidden agendas</i>, heroes rise from the shadows. By the order of the secret Galactic Guardian, worlds shift, villains fall and rise, and balance must be maintained... at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/7b9b1d402fdcd47e34428a2f65d7037b.avif?t=1759946563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras_big/7b9b1d402fdcd47e34428a2f65d7037b.avif?t=1759946563 width=800 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras/c8408a3abf36d79b35f4a69c6d7137c2.avif?t=1759946563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566940/extras_big/c8408a3abf36d79b35f4a69c6d7137c2.avif?t=1759946563 width=800 height=73 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Welcome aboard, Agent.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a destined top-tier galactic operative, dispatched to hostile worlds to eliminate high-profile alien threats. Each mission is a test of skill, strategy, and survival. The contracts are ruthless, the enemies relentless\u2014but failure is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills, test a variety of weapons, and uncover ancient magical runes to enhance your abilities. Adapt, evolve, and become the ultimate agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in, strike fast, and vanish without a trace. The fate of the galaxy is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to restore order from the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0YOUR MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable <strong>coins</strong> as you eliminate enemies and complete high-risk contracts across the galaxy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to <strong>upgrade your agent</strong>, enhancing speed, strength, and resilience to survive increasingly brutal missions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a <strong>deadly arsenal of weapons</strong>, from high-tech blasters to devastating explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >harness the power of <strong>ancient runes</strong> to gain supernatural abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, deadlier <strong>bosses</strong> will rise to challenge you, pushing your skills to the limit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and conquer <strong>new planets</strong>, each with its own dangers, secrets, and rewards\u2014because only the most <strong>relentless</strong> agents can uncover the true chaos lurking in the stars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good Luck, Agent. We Are Expecting Yo